cpp-dependencies
------------------------------------------
Tool to check C++ #include dependencies (dependency graphs created in .dot
format)

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libboost_filesystem1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_system1.66-1.66.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/tomtom-international/cpp-dependencies

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/tomtom-international/cpp-dependencies/archive/refs/tags/1.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack cpp-dependencies-1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./cpp-dependencies-1.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/cpp-dependencies-1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/cpp-dependencies-1.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(cpp-dependencies)
  /usr/bin/cpp-dependencies.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/cpp-dependencies.README
  /usr/share/doc/cpp-dependencies/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/cpp-dependencies/NOTICE
  /usr/share/doc/cpp-dependencies/README.md

